Comments:
1. Following Gai et al. 1987, Goerres et al. 1992 and Lugaro et al. 2004, we consider 9 natural parity levels, 
   including one below threshold.
2. Resonance energies are derived from excitation energies (Tilley et al. 1995) and latest mass tables.
3. Seven resonance strengths and radiative widths are taken from Gai et al. 1987; averages with Goerres et al. when available
4. Alpha-particle widths for the -28 and 178 keV resonances are extracted from the alpha transfer experiment of
   Cunsolo et al. 1981, assuming a factor of two uncertainty.
5. Non-resonant contribution is adopted from Goerres et al. 1992.
6. In this file, S(E) above 2.5 MeV is taken from a TALYS calculation with increasing uncertainties.